  "question": {
    "text": "$\\int_{0}^{10} \\frac{x^{10}}{(10-x)^{10}+x^{10}} d x$ is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "10",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "5",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "2",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{0}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $I=\\int_{0}^{10} \\frac{x^{10}}{(10-x)^{10}+x^{10}} d x$...(1)\r\n\r\n$I=\\int_{0}^{10} \\frac{(10-x)^{10}}{(10-x)^{10}+x^{10}} d x$...(2)\r\n\r\nAdding\r\n\r\n(1) and (2), we get\r\n\r\n$2 I=\\int_{0}^{10} d x \\Rightarrow 2 I=10 \\Rightarrow I=5$"
  }
}